<title>LATVIA: OLAINFARM GAINS AGAIN IN EARLY BOURSE.</title>
<headline>OLAINFARM GAINS AGAIN IN EARLY BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in drugs maker Olainfarm</p>
<p>rebounded to the 2.40 lats level, where it has gone back to</p>
<p>after every dip to lower prices.</p>
<p>Dealers have said that Estonian investors who bought shares</p>
<p>in Olainfarm at 2.50 lats are trying to keep the price at the</p>
<p>higher level at which it joined the bourse last Monday.</p>
<p>Other shares were stable, with Unibanka losing 10 santimes</p>
<p>to 3.12 lats.</p>
<p>Shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following prices</p>
<p>and in the following volume, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
